@startuml F1.5-D06-preferencias-notif
title F1.5-D06 — Preferências de notificação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "NotifPrefsController" as Ctrl
participant "NotifPrefsUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: ajusta canais/DND/digest / Salvar
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /me/notifications
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)

note right of UC
  Revalida CRITICAL
  (backend não confia no cliente)
  RN-F1.5-01
end note

UC -> Postgres: UPSERT notif_prefs
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 OK
WebApp --> Aluno: preferências salvas

@enduml
